  <h1 class=3D"article-title">
          The Different Ways of Getting SVG Out of Adobe&nbsp;Illustrator  =
    </h1>

      <div class=3D"author-row">

   =20
          <img style=3D"border-radius: 50%;" src=3D"https://secure.gravatar=
.com/avatar/a8e040142716a4b44d014d80fbcf99c635b1d8faabfe469b6954a8ef2f16859=
5?s=3D80&amp;d=3Dretro&amp;r=3Dpg">
   =20
    <div>
     =20
             =20
        <a class=3D"author-name" href=3D"https://css-tricks.com/author/geof=
fgraham/">
          Geoff Graham        </a>
     =20
        on
     =20
              <time datetime=3D"">
          Nov 18, 2016        </time>
     =20
    </div>

 =20
</div>
 =20
</header>
